OL,3,GNEWSAMan murdered woman for own
OL,4,Asadistic pleasure, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman was "manipulated for years" by
OL,7,Fa man she met on a fetish website who
OL,8,Fwent on to murder her "for his own
OL,9,Fsadistic pleasure", a court in the
OL,10,FUnited States has heard.
OL,12,FDwain Hall, 54, is on trial for the
OL,13,Fkidnap and murder Sonia Exelby, whose
OL,14,Fbody was found in Marion County,
OL,15,FFlorida, on 17 October 2025 after she
OL,16,Fwas reported missing from her home in
OL,17,FSouthsea, Hampshire, five days earlier.
