OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trial of Hall, whose online
OL,7,Fusername was Alpha Sadist, was told he
OL,8,Fhad been the "executioner" of Sonia
OL,9,FExelby and had demanded she pay $4,000
OL,10,F(#3,000) for him to kill her when she
OL,11,Ftravelled to the US.
OL,13,FThe proceedings in Florida heard that
OL,14,Fthe 32-year-old had wanted to die. Hall
OL,15,Fdenies the charges.
